    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I’ve used AI tools like Wolfram Alpha and my phone’s calculator app. They're quick and accurate. For a second-order equation, I simply entered the values and it gave me the roots. It’s not a replacement for understanding, but it helps me verify my work and get started.",
