    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could offer personalized tutoring. A student could ask a question or present a problem, and the LLM could walk them through a solution. This supports those who struggle and allows for more flexible learning. It could also generate custom worksheets and simulations, helping to visualize abstract concepts."
